# RTL / fa-IR UI

- Root: `dir="rtl"` and `lang="fa-IR"`.
- Use logical CSS (`ms`/`me`, `ps`/`pe`, `start`/`end`) — avoid raw `left`/`right` unless mirroring icons.
- Persian numerals only when product copy requires them; keep code/IDs ASCII.
- Fonts: load a purposeful Persian-capable display + body pair; never default Inter/Roboto/Arial stacks for marketing surfaces.
- Landing hero: brand-first, one headline, one support line, one CTA group, one dominant visual — no card grids in the hero.
- Motion: intentional GSAP/scroll scenes (2–3), not decorative noise.
